{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026LTrps5OrJA1787291644.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">解放軍駐港部隊車輛與警察電單車相撞，警員輕傷送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TM-1030.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026nz2g7izjTW1787291672.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TM-1030.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在昨晚約11時，一個男警員駕駛電單車沿元朗公路往上水方向行駛，駛至近洪天路時與駐港解放軍車輛相撞。男警員受輕傷，送往屯門醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T05:59:40.709722+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}